Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,齊聚一堂的各位女神男神們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,請大家安靜聆聽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,本次的救世難度竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是S級別
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而被選中拯救這個世界的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,治癒女神莉絲妲黛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊 莉絲妲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這是很有成就感的工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能完成這項任務
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能成為獨當一面的女神了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:31.34,Style01,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(1526,725)\fad(650,650)}治癒女神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:31.34,Style01,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(1527,850)\fad(650,650)}莉絲妲黛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我會努力多積累經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,爭取讓自己早日成為上位女神的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧 啊啊啊啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然是難度S級…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫莉絲妲 也就是莉絲妲黛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大約在一百年前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,誕生在這統一神界的女神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然後 我至今為止共有五次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,從地上召喚勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救陷入苦難的世界的經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 不過與其他資深的神相比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,區區五次還是算太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,其他男神女神平均次數有數十次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,比較多的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至有數百次拯救地上世界的經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,順帶一提 所謂難度S
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是連那些資深的神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都會有所忌憚的 可怕世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,關鍵的勇者召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我決定和往常一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,從日本的年輕人裡進行挑選
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因為異世界轉生的書籍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在日本似乎挺受歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他們很快就能理解我們這邊的意圖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然熱潮已經有所消退
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但異世界依然是熱門
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如今依然充斥在市場上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在跟誰說明呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是累了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一個世界最多只能召喚一個勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,鈴木
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,佐佐木
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,鈴木
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,山田
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.59,0:02:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,佐佐木
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,佐藤鈴木田中佐佐木山田佐佐木
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鈴木山田山田田中山田佐佐木鈴木
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼看全都是一樣的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 怎麼樣都好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 這什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,明明才等級一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這強的可怕的能力值是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,從…從來沒看見過有這種能力值的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,人才
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他絕對是個人才沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且還是百萬人之中才有一個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 是一億人之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才有一個的人才啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是他的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,應該很快就能攻略「蓋亞布蘭德」了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而我又能朝向成為大女神的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,邁出一大步了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我這是何等的好運啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,以女神莉絲妲黛之名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在此召喚勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,龍宮院聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,討 討厭啦 好帥喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,超過180公分的身高
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,清爽的黑髮下是凜凜有神的臉龐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,周圍散發著不遜於
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,統一神界男神們的神聖氣場
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.13,0:04:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好想和這樣的男人談一唱火熱的戀愛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在想什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,女神和人類之間談戀愛是禁止的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫莉絲妲黛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是居住在統一神界的女神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,基於一些原因
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.98,0:04:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,將你從地上召喚到了這個次元
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽好了 龍宮院聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你正是能將世界「蓋亞布蘭德」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,從魔王的手中拯救出來的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是看上我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我是女神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,說白了 就是好女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,被我這完美的女性美吸引
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喪失了語言能力吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,被奇怪的人突然說這些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是不太明白呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 這是在說我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 威嚴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,身為女神要保持威嚴才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.11,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我並非什麼來路不明的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是女神
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是召喚作為勇者的你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,天界的女神…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真的是神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那你自己去救那個什麼世界不就行了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因為有規定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,神為了讓人類靠自己的力量繁榮起來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.55,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,才創造了無數的地上世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救人類世界的必須要是人類自己才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有拒絕權嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,自由裁量權呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.87,0:05:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那修正規則的選舉權呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,還真是自私自利呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,麻煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 突然被召喚過來也會急躁也是正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,這種時候就要用大多數日本人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都會興奮起來的這招
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,來 你現在先喊一下「能力值」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(1165,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 難道說你不怎麼玩遊戲的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(1165,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 你只要大喊「能力值」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你的能力就會以數值的形式顯示出來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧 你喊喊看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\pos(960,1002)}property
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,屬性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\37\pos(960,1002)}property
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,屬性
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(1138,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我是叫你喊「能力值」啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs37\pos(903,1002)}property
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,而且「屬性」是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,完全搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,的確 上面寫著只有我才知道的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,本來很懷疑你這傢伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,現在看來你的話多少還是有點可信度的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你從剛才開始就對女神很沒禮貌耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(640,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(1220,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,「能力值」 你先喊一下「能力值」啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好嗎 好嗎 算我求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(960,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.78,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,「能力值」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 能看明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是比一般勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,強上好幾倍的能力值喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一億人之中才有一個的人才
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,能打倒蓋亞布蘭德的魔王的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,龍宮院聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,就只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,順便問一下 要是我在那個世界死掉會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真是麻煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然無法再進入蓋亞布蘭德了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但你只會回到原本的世界而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,疑心真的很重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他是不親自去現場就感受不到實感的類型嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉 回頭再好好給你說明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,開啟吧 異界之門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧 龍宮院聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:07:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,蓋亞布蘭德的命運就掌握在你手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很期待會是怎樣的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我說我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.33,0:07:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼能突然就去危險的異世界呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…可是…可是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你的能力值真的非常高喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我也會在你身旁支援你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也不是像樣的支援吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是失禮呢 我可是女神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我絕對不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你受傷了的話我還可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.53,0:07:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,用治癒魔法給你恢復喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也只是後方人員
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,對拯救世界也起不了多大作用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.15,0:07:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,面對女神他這是什麼態度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好想打他一頓啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果無法拒絕前往異世界的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我也有相應的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,條件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,條件是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是 要對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦 不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,女神和人類之間的戀情是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,至少先讓我做好充足的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.84,0:07:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我自己能認同為止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼回事啊 這個勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.34,0:08:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那個時候 我終於注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我漏看了一個重要的項目…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:12.03,Background,,0,0,0,,{\fs130\bord0\shad0\1c&H000000&\frz22\move(766,446,710,385)\t(\frz24)}性格:難以置信的慎重
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那個人真的是太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 結果怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直在做訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在我家附近的空屋子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:10:01.53,Style01,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(1526,760)\fad(650,650)}封印女神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:10:01.53,Style01,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(1527,865)\fad(650,650)}阿麗雅朵亞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一般來說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,應該都會想立刻去看看異世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,莉絲妲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你要攻略的是難度S的世界蓋亞布蘭德
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,像他那樣的慎重說不定反而比較好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就算這樣 也太浪費時間了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去現場和怪物戰鬥的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,升級也會比較快的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼關係嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不用這麼著急嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這個統一神界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,相對與地上 時間的流動可是慢得多的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是想進行更普通的冒險的說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要好好協助他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,既然他現在正在做訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就該好好照顧他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,照顧他？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那個空蕩蕩的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你有放置廁所 浴室和床鋪之類的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他肚子應該也餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你這麼一說…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,另外就是 莉絲妲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他大概是不喜歡神這樣高高在上的態度
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你要更像朋友那樣和他接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 阿麗雅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是大前輩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 一點沒變呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一直把你放著不管 真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh 六塊腹肌…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 進房間之前起碼要敲個門啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.95,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,話說 這裡又不是你的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的肚子應該餓了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉是日本人對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我準備了飯團
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這個是梅幹的 這個是鮭魚的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,來路不明的人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,來路不明的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說 我不是什麼來路不明的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沒禮貌也該有個限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你先吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面說不定下了毒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我有什麼理由對你下毒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 沒有問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 虧我這麼努力做飯團給你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看來裡面沒有放即效性的毒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,延遲性的毒藥也沒有放啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,還有我先告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你就算做伏地挺身或仰臥起坐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也不會提升多少能力的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一天三餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我會放在你的門前的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,準備好了就用這個聯絡器通知我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在聯絡器響起前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是絕對不會靠近這間房的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,還有什麼不滿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這東西會不會安裝了炸彈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,隨便你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,反正兩三天肯定就會堅持不住的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.47,Style02,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(993,870)\fad(50,400)}4  天  後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有響
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有響啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,該不會是壞了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他已經死掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不過飯團都有吃掉了的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再觀察一下情況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:43.20,Style02,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正正准黑_GBK\pos(940,825)\fad(50,400)}一周後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有響
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有響啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,響了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(960,1002)}SEXY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好性感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而且有肥皂的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說 要先敲門
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你修行的成果怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(960,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,「能力值」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只…只是肌力訓練 居然升了這麼多級
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是特殊技能「獲得經驗值增加」的影響嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然還習得了特技
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.09,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我本來想把等級練滿再去的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想在這房子裡結束一生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就算這裡時間流速再怎麼慢也是有限度的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,趕快出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,前往蓋亞布蘭德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready perfectly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.99,0:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,完全準備充分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼 招牌臺詞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,還耍帥什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那種臺詞就不必講了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 出發吧 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是請大女神伊希絲妲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,調整過的絕佳位置喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去那邊的艾多納鎮整頓裝備吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:08.95,Style04,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正跃进体_GBK\pos(962,858)\fad(80,400)}艾多納鎮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你們好 兩位是旅行者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真是讓人驚訝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,明明一身暴露狂的打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,居然還能正常的打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你說誰是暴露狂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.01,0:14:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經用女神之力讓這件衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來像是普通的衣服了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一時間還是無法相信
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才的人不是很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.09,0:14:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,實際上 說不定是個怪物之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是普通的鎮子上居民吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,表面上是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但他說不定是怪物變身假扮的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.03,0:14:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就算不是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他也有可能是殺人狂或者兇惡的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那就在被他殺死前先一步…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣的想法才更像兇惡的罪犯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,大姐姐你好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,簡直像女神一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,純粹的小孩子就是能看穿本質呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥哥雖然穿得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不過好帥氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.81,0:15:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,面對小孩就不會口出惡言了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥哥你的名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 呐 名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是妮娜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然還想再多看看這兩個人的互動的說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 妮娜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這個城鎮的武器店在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,武器店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,從這裡一直直走就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 妮娜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.65,0:15:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我送給你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有這些錢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就能買到這個城鎮最好的裝備了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這副鋼鐵盔甲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,選的還不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,給我三副
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,給我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,盔甲不需要這麼多的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 需要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,穿著用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,備用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,還有備用不見時的備用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是盔甲狂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哪個世界的勇者會把所有的金幣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,全部用來買三副一樣的盔甲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我來幫你選 聖哉就待在那別動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真是個自作主張的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.35,0:16:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這與其說是慎重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不如說是病態了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 挺像樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來也像是位出色的勇者了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,煙霧彈三十個 藥草五十個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.91,0:16:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,解毒草也要一樣的數量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那些的確是比盔甲便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是很便宜沒錯 但需要這麼多嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道外面會有多麼兇惡的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.18,0:16:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,準備一下是理所當然的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,別看我這樣 我可是經驗老道的嚮導喲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我有好好選一個適合起步的城鎮開始哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這附近都是些弱小的怪物啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這可難說了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 你說你是個老手這項情報就很可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你疑心病到底要有多重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,連我都可以一個人走到隔壁鎮子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因為
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這附近只有史萊姆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,連這麼小的孩子都說沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣你應該能稍微安心一點了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥哥看起來很強的說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,卻害怕城鎮外面去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這個大哥哥很膽小的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那這個給你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,護身符
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就送給大哥哥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,該不會 這是受到詛咒的道具…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？ 什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這位大哥哥只是有點毛病而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,妮娜 你在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,剛剛 我女兒沒做什麼失禮的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.77,0:17:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.61,0:17:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,對 沒有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,原來也不是那麼惹人厭的傢伙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好 這就去和怪物戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有必要特地去陷入危險中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不用擔心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你都已經有很好的裝備了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 那個就是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是基因改造之類的產物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,它是魔物啦 史萊姆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你沒在遊戲裡見過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,還有這種日本人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,史萊姆雖然會跳起來攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但成年人用棍棒就可以打倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,弱小怪物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.34,0:18:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「原子分裂斬」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs37}AtomicSplitSlash
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不過是對付史萊姆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣未免太過火了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它說不定還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「地獄業火」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45}Hell's Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說 史萊姆已經沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,還不能放心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,現在能用的特技應該只有兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:18:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底打算做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「原子分裂斬」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs37}Atomic Split Slash
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然又用了一次原子分裂斬
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.73,0:19:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「地獄業火」
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.73,0:19:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45}Hell's Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,又用了一次火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.26,0:19:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你是還要再用幾次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,夠了 快住手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,原子分裂……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs37\pos(902,1000)}Atomic Split
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,話說只是對付一隻史萊姆到底要做到什麼地步
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一開始用原子什麼的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它就已經碎成渣了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事不可大意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那也該有個限度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該也有「能力透視」的技能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒看到史萊姆的能力值嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且有看過了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,攻擊力和防禦力都是一位數
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此也就不用做到這個地步吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛所能看到的情報未必是全部
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你應該更加相信自己的技能一些啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,總之
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該稍微有些自信了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在真的很強
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以趕快前往下一個城鎮…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.57,0:20:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真是驚人的劍技呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你吧 一定就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面 女神大人和勇者大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我是魔王軍直屬的四天王之一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,凱歐斯•馬其納
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一上來就是四天王 這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.95,Style05,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\b1\pos(1585,792)\fad(80,400)}魔王軍四天王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:27.95,Style05,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\b1\pos(1584,890)\fad(80,400)}凱歐斯•馬其納
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.27,0:20:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的魔王大人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在事前就感知到勇者召喚的前兆了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一般剛被召喚的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,都會選擇弱小怪物的棲息地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就鎖定了這一帶的村莊和城鎮的附近
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,最後來到了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是難度S的蓋亞布蘭德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不能以常理來思考啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.90,0:20:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,魔王大人相當的戒備勇者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我覺得不用這麼擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.37,0:21:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…可是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣一對峙我就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是位蘊含著可怕能力的勇者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊…不行啊…不行啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不趁早把你解決掉不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙了 要快點使用能力透視
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這根本不是初期會遭遇到的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,該有的能力值啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(1014,1002)}status
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.99,0:21:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,總之先快速擾亂她 然後…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 聖哉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.51,0:21:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你在搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,毫不遲疑地逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.69,0:21:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不錯的判斷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,普通人類是不會這麼當機立斷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,採取這種行動的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣…真有趣…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是個有趣的勇者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,給我等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要丟下女神自己逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊啊啊
