Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:52.42,ED-SC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不要 呐 你要去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:53.40,EDO-SC,,0,0,0,,{\move(1834,978,1834,700)\fad(0,200)}Keep up keep up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:56.48,ED-SC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}如果在此別離將會是平凡之果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.13,ED-SC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}請不要離開我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.24,0:23:02.53,ED-SC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我對你只有一個請求
